## Checker notes (numbers lane)
The checker maps Vietnamese number words to digits, so "một" counts as 1. 018 §3 therefore keeps the digit in
"mỗi cổ đông có 1 phiếu biểu quyết" (spelling it "một" made the lane FAIL "missing 1"); the reviewer's meaning is
preserved. Per-file WARNs after the fix, against the HEAD baseline (checked by running the checker on
`git show HEAD:` copies):
  003  was 수사미해석 (3) → now "extra 2020" (1)   — deliberate, a#33
  007  was 수사미해석 (4) → now "extra 2023" (4)   — deliberate, a#44
