  004  "extra 0" + nationality WARN  — BOTH pre-existing at HEAD, unchanged by this lane
  006, 009  numbers WARN — pre-existing at HEAD, unchanged
  011  수사미해석 제7호 — pre-existing at HEAD, unchanged
